cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SciModel
message: "If SciModel contributes to your work, please cite this project."
type: software
abstract: >-
  An open-source scientific modeling assistant that discovers candidate equations
  from experimental data (model library, sparse and symbolic regression, optional
  language-model hypotheses), ranks them with search-adjusted information criteria,
  grades their quality, and writes reproducible reports.
repository-code: https://github.com/ialirezaesrafili/scimodel
url: https://github.com/ialirezaesrafili/scimodel
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0rc1
date-released: 2026-10-19
authors:
  - name: SciModel contributors
keywords:
  - scientific modeling
  - equation discovery
  - symbolic regression
  - model selection
  - reproducible research
